# Only the tooling is tracked. Everything else in this directory is derived
# from the source question pool, a third-party document, or a personal study
# record. Adding a new tracked file means adding it here first.
*
!/.gitignore
!/*.py
!/cramfest.html

# Named individually rather than as !/*.md, which would re-admit the personal
# quiz results the list above exists to exclude.
!/SPEC.md
!/README.md
!/LICENSE

# Worktrees are excluded explicitly, not left to the catch-all above, so the
# entry survives any future move away from a deny-all list.
.claude/worktrees/
